SY_TALK("ZSgxc7vLMbg",[[2,["Shri Ganesha Puja. Cabella Ligure (Italy), 10 September 1995."]],[580,["With all the Ganapatis sitting around me"]],[585,["and you all the ganas sitting in front of me,"]],[589,["I don’t know what to say."]],[594,["It’s remarkable, very remarkable,"]],[598,["because most of you come from a culture"]],[603,["which has never shown any respect of Shri Ganesh."]],[607,["They never realised how important it was that,"]],[612,["without Shri Ganesha’s qualities,"]],[617,["we cannot achieve anything in our life."]],[624,["The idea of everyday, moment-to-moment enjoyment has destroyed them."]],[633,["And also the desire to know the Divine"]],[647,["vanishes also in the thin air"]],[651,["because you get lost into this moment-to-moment enjoyment"]],[658,["till you get destructive, completely destroyed."]],[663,["But I really don’t understand how you have achieved this state"]],[672,["where you see [that] the purity is so important to life;"]],[677,["that Ganesha’s qualities, His value system"]],[687,["and His innocence are to be imbibed."]],[696,["I feel very gratified that such a thing has happened now in your lives"]],[706,["and you all are so much in praise for Shri Ganesha."]],[715,["Shri Ganesha is there from our childhood."]],[721,["Yesterday you saw the children, how they were so beautiful"]],[725,["and entertained us the most."]],[727,["Everybody had a smile on their face and I said,"]],[731,["“Don’t laugh,” because if you laugh they feel a little offended"]],[736,["and they think that you are laughing at them."]],[743,["The enjoyment that we had from that drama of children"]],[751,["was more than what one would expect"]],[757,["from adults doing that kind of a drama just to entertain us."]],[763,["It might be some sort of a very subtle joy of Shri Ganesha"]],[769,["that made us so happy."]],[772,["We all have Shri Ganesh settled very nicely within ourselves"]],[778,["and, in you, awakened; awakened in such a manner"]],[785,["that, in your free will also, you do not want to do things"]],[791,["that will go against Shri Ganesha."]],[796,["His manifestation within you is so evident."]],[801,["you see your faces – they are so beautifully shining,"]],[807,["so very different from other people."]],[810,["One day I was travelling from London"]],[814,["and there was one Indian lady who came to see me and she said,"]],[820,["“I was surprised to see your disciples. Their faces were shining"]],[826,["with such light. I have never seen any disciples like that.”"]],[834,["I asked her, “Who are you?”"]],[839,["She said, “I am married in Guru Nanak’s family"]],[843,["and all the people in his family are just the opposite"]],[849,["[of] what Guru Nanak was.”"]],[854,["So I said, “Because they worship Shri Ganesha.”"]],[859,["So she said that, “In our family nobody worships Shri Ganesh.”"]],[865,["I said, “It cannot be possible! How is it?”"]],[869,["They believe in nirakar, in the formless God of chaitanya."]],[878,["I said, “But who is the source of that chaitanya?"]],[882,["Why don’t they find out who is the source?”"]],[885,["So they said that Nanaka has only talked up to this point."]],[890,["He’s not talked about the source."]],[897,["I said, “Better find out,"]],[900,["because in this book maybe some things have been taken away.”"]],[905,["And then somebody gave me a passage where he had described"]],[910,["the innocence, the Deity of Shri Ganesha also."]],[915,["He had described that the whole Creation was done by the Mother"]],[922,["and not by the Father."]],[924,["It’s very surprising because nirakaris,"]],[927,["those people, who don’t believe in the forms of God,"]],[933,["always talk of Father, not of the Mother."]],[936,["It is true also about Christianity, also about Islam,"]],[948,["also about the Jews."]],[954,["All of them, they talk of the Father and not of the Mother,"]],[960,["nor about Shri Ganesh."]],[964,["It seems, in the ancient times they believed in child God,"]],[971,["even in China, even in Greece and also in many other countries"]],[979,["who were supposed to be primitive. But they all believed in the child God."]],[988,["So now, when we deal with our children,"]],[993,["we should know that they are just like Shri Ganesh:"]],[999,["they are very innocent, very simple;"]],[1003,["except in cases sometimes [where] they are affected by some things"]],[1009,["and they lose their moorings."]],[1016,["But Shri Ganesha’s greatest contribution to Sahaja Yoga is"]],[1023,["that He makes you feel My vibrations."]],[1028,["He makes you feel the beauty of purity and simplicity."]],[1036,["[It’s] only possible if Shri Ganesha is awakened within you."]],[1042,["Also the Kundalini won’t rise without the sanction of this ‘chancellor’."]],[1048,["He’s the one sitting on Mooladhara."]],[1052,["But you should know He is on every chakra."]],[1057,["Innocence cures all the maladies, physical, mental, emotional,"]],[1066,["specially the spiritual one."]],[1070,["But Shri Ganesha’s quality, the most important, is"]],[1076,["that He believes in emitting vibrations,"]],[1081,["He believes in projecting His vibrations to everyone."]],[1089,["That is the quality now [that] I feel all of you, as Sahaja Yogis, can use."]],[1099,["You got your Realisation without any effort I should say."]],[1106,["It was Sahaj."]],[1109,["The life before Self-realisation was different."]],[1115,["You got your transformation"]],[1118,["and you have jumped into the new era of Meta Science."]],[1129,["But here now we have to see"]],[1131,["whatever we have got, what are we to do with it?"]],[1137,["You, of course, know that you have to give Realisations to others,"]],[1142,["you have to cure people, you have to love them"]],[1150,["and you have to be compassionate"]],[1153,["but apart from that, now the deliberations about yourself have to start."]],[1161,["That is through Shri Ganesha’s powers that are within you."]],[1166,["You should see that you can emit your powers your energy to others."]],[1175,["You can project it to others."]],[1178,["Now, for example, If somebody comes to you, meets you,"]],[1187,["if you know how to deliberately project your energy."]],[1194,["This is a new type of meditation you have to practise now:"]],[1199,["that to emit your energy, project your energy to others."]],[1203,["You don’t have to say anything, you don’t have to talk"]],[1207,["but just feel deliberately – again I say deliberately."]],[1212,["It’s not sahaj, it’s not spontaneous."]],[1215,["This is what you have to practise,"]],[1217,["is to emit your energy of your innocence of Shri Ganesha to others"]],[1224,["so, when they see you, their innocence would be awakened."]],[1230,["Now, for example, say"]],[1237,["we had some problems in London and Sahaj Yogis told me,"]],[1243,["“Mother, there are still some men are looking at us.”"]],[1247,["And some said that, “There are many women who are looking at us.”"]],[1253,["It was a mutual sort of a thing going on."]],[1258,["I said, “You can project your energy in such a manner"]],[1267,["that that projection will stop all this kind of stupid behaviour of other people"]],[1274,["and also make them understand, respect you and feel your dignity.”"]],[1282,["Not very difficult."]],[1284,["But, on the contrary, as the culture is"]],[1289,["to attract men and attract women it will diminish."]],[1297,["The energy will diminish."]],[1300,["When you feel your own dignity and serenity"]],[1309,["and [realise] that you are now Self-realised people,"]],[1315,["you are not ordinary people"]],[1317,["a kind of majestic personality develops within you."]],[1323,["That majestic personality really can have a tremendous effect"]],[1332,["on the surrounding people – tremendous!"]],[1337,["It’s a kind of a deliberate projection you should start."]],[1341,["I don’t know that side, that how to project it"]],[1347,["or how to deliberately do this."]],[1350,["It’s just spontaneous with me, it just happens."]],[1354,["But you can achieve it yourself with [a] little practice."]],[1357,["Try to face such people, not with disdain or contempt,"]],[1370,["but just your majestic personality."]],[1375,["This personality is here now, you see,"]],[1379,["is sitting in such a majestic manner"]],[1384,["and is also giving the vibrations to others."]],[1391,["The whole figure is doing something suddenly to people."]],[1402,["To expect that the whole world will change spontaneously,"]],[1407,["I don’t think is alright."]],[1411,["Because, you know, the world is so chaotic, full of so much chaos,"]],[1416,["so much ego, so much conditioning."]],[1420,["But something within you can rise above others"]],[1428,["with your sense of dignity, with your complete Selfhood,"]],[1438,["where you stand with yourself."]],[1441,["You are not to be rude, you are not to be egoistical,"]],[1445,["you need not say things if you don’t want to say anything."]],[1450,["Just that silent personality can emit such beautiful vibrations,"]],[1458,["which you have. You have stored up a lot of vibrations within yourself."]],[1463,["And this storing up is showing on your faces, which I said are shining."]],[1470,["But the innocence that you have,"]],[1474,["you have to be proud of it, very much proud of it."]],[1479,["Even now sometimes you feel that people will say"]],[1487,["you are not properly dressed up"]],[1491,["or maybe you are ugly looking or all kinds of things"]],[1494,["that they expect every other person to be."]],[1497,["It’s a funny thing that in this world"]],[1501,["all human beings expect others to be very good."]],[1504,["Everybody should be a hero or something"]],[1507,["– what about themselves they never think!"]],[1509,["So now you have become heroes in the sense that"]],[1513,["spiritually you are much higher than all of them."]],[1517,["So this projection, when it starts – I am saying again ‘deliberate’ –"]],[1522,["then you should not be afraid that, “I will develop my ego.”"]],[1527,["You should not be afraid that, “I’ll get some conditionings.”"]],[1531,["But just, in the way, with the understanding,"]],[1536,["that you have these powers within you, beautifully expressing themselves,"]],[1542,["as a child does."]],[1545,["If there is one child, it can entertain at least hundred people."]],[1551,["What is so sweet about the child? Is the innocence:"]],[1555,["the way he speaks, the way he talks, the way he behaves,"]],[1561,["the way he expresses his love. It’s so simple"]],[1565,["but it has something in the essence, this innocence of Shri Ganesha."]],[1574,["Anywhere there’s a question of children,"]],[1580,["the whole world get worried about it,"]],[1584,["the whole world wants to solve the problem."]],[1588,["If a child is in trouble, anywhere all over the world"]],[1595,["it will be circulated that such and such a thing is happening"]],[1599,["to such a child and everybody will be worried."]],[1603,["If they see a child anywhere, the faces change;"]],[1609,["you see the faces, the expression changes, automatically."]],[1613,["Because that child is emitting that innocence;"]],[1618,["without any deliberations, without any special way of doing it,"]],[1627,["but just spontaneously."]],[1630,["But then you grow, you start growing, growing with others"]],[1637,["who are also not innocent. You have to meet them."]],[1641,["You can’t run away from the society."]],[1644,["You start getting all the rapport with such people"]],[1653,["who are talking about things"]],[1657,["– actually, those who are criticising Shri Ganesha."]],[1661,["Gradually, your innocence starts dying out"]],[1667,["and you feel sometimes inferior to all those"]],[1671,["who are supposed to be very great warriors against innocence."]],[1678,["In the sense that – when I was in London"]],[1685,["I saw they all used to laugh at me because I had this kumkum."]],[1690,["But I used to think they don’t know why I am wearing it."]],[1694,["So, it’s so ignorant they are:"]],[1696,["very ignorant people that they don’t know in India"]],[1700,["all the married women have to wear this."]],[1703,["Even the Muslims wear that; they also wear mangalsutra."]],[1709,["So I said that,"]],[1710,["“This is just written down, on my head, that I am a married woman.”"]],[1715,["It’s just to tell people ‘don’t bother me."]],[1718,["I have got my husband behind me and he can take you to task.’"]],[1725,["This kind of ignorance is so much in the West"]],[1731,["and still they think they are a higher race, they are greater people."]],[1736,["They don’t know even small, small things about life."]],[1741,["For the innocence, I think"]],[1744,["they have lost any knowledge about it, long time back."]],[1752,["And that’s how it is a society, today,"]],[1756,["which has absolutely lost its own moorings."]],[1762,["Every individual is separate,"]],[1764,["every individual is doing something and they don’t know each other."]],[1769,["Without innocence you cannot have a rapport with other people."]],[1775,["Because that means you have some sort of a lust"]],[1780,["or greed behind the whole thing."]],[1783,["So much so now, it’s become so boring the whole thing,"]],[1789,["that even once I told this Sahaj Yogi that, if you are going there,"]],[1794,["there’s a family and they have a daughter,"]],[1798,["so just give this present to her – a simple thing!"]],[1804,["Now this yogi was quite an elderly person, not a young boy."]],[1809,["He said, “Mother, I’d better not go.” I said, “Why?”"]],[1812,["“Because they will misunderstand me.”"]],[1815,["“What will they misunderstand?”"]],[1817,["“Why am I giving a present to this girl?”"]],[1821,["I said, “But it’s I am giving. What is the harm?”"]],[1824,["“No!” That’s the psychology. He was himself a psychologist."]],[1828,["That’s the psychology. “So I cannot take this present for that girl!”"]],[1832,["I mean, I was [amazed]: for Indians, you don’t understand this kind of a fear."]],[1837,["But then I noticed it’s too much"]],[1840,["that they don’t want to be with any woman,"]],[1844,["they don’t want to be alone with any woman."]],[1847,["And they said Mother, “You don’t know these women!"]],[1851,["They will make a rape case out of us!” “But how?”"]],[1854,["“They do!” So the whole idea is to challenge the innocence of people."]],[1864,["For that, I must say, they made this Freud into a god"]],[1871,["because of his writings. I don’t know how they accept, also, such writings."]],[1877,["I just can’t understand how they accept."]],[1879,["Because I think they have no idea as to what they are."]],[1885,["Somebody asked me about Freud, “Then what did he say?"]],[1890,["Why are people so much against him? Why are you so against?”"]],[1893,["I said, “He said that there’s a bad relationship between the mother and the son.”"]],[1898,["He just jumped. “He said so? My goodness! Thank God he never came to India,"]],[1904,["otherwise we would have cut him into pieces and put them in the Indian Sea!”"]],[1909,["I said, “But why spoil the purity of Indian Sea also?”"]],[1916,["He was so annoyed and angry, he said,"]],[1919,["“How could they tolerate such a nonsense?"]],[1922,["How could they accept such nonsense against the mother?"]],[1925,["They have no purity?” I said, “That’s the trouble with them.”"]],[1930,["Now the trouble is that the brain developed too much,"]],[1933,["ego developed too much and any such stupid idea"]],[1938,["– it’s much worse than stupid – was accepted."]],[1943,["And that is how I find it’s so boring:"]],[1947,["every time anywhere you go it’s nothing but this sex business."]],[1956,["It’s too much. I can’t understand how people go on tolerating."]],[1960,["It’s alright, at the most, in some adult films you might show some nonsense,"]],[1966,["but every time you see something you find"]],[1970,["suddenly this kind of nonsensical scene is coming,"]],[1974,["this bedroom scenes, these scenes, and people like it."]],[1978,["They pay for it. They want to have all aspects of it."]],[1987,["It is such a natural thing. What is there to talk about it all the time?"]],[1992,["I don’t understand."]],[1994,["It’s only the development of the brain, of such a manner,"]],[1998,["that every kind of nonsense it wants to accept."]],[2002,["“So what? What’s wrong?”"]],[2004,["“Well, you’re mad! That’s what. You go to lunatic asylum.”"]],[2008,["Lunatics also talk like that. “So what’s wrong?”"]],[2011,["Same way. Because of such acceptance, they don’t know how much"]],[2017,["people have ruined their family life, their children’s life."]],[2022,["In every way, we find that the whole society is full of this nonsense"]],[2028,["and specially in the television – Italy specially."]],[2033,["I mean, certain buttons you should not press,"]],[2040,["you should be very careful,"]],[2042,["otherwise you don’t know what you face and you go for vomiting."]],[2044,["You see, as Indians – first reaction is to vomit."]],[2050,["But for people who have not yet realized the value of this innocence"]],[2059,["can be easily taken up by this kind of nonsense that’s going on."]],[2068,["Whatever it is, through the blessings of Shri Ganesha,"]],[2072,["you are all transformed. You are on a different line."]],[2080,["Yesterday these two musicians were surprised how you were praising Ganesha."]],[2086,["They couldn’t believe it, how you could praise Shri Ganesh,"]],[2090,["because you haven’t even heard the name of Shri Ganesha before"]],[2094,["I said, “They see what Shri Ganesha has done to them,"]],[2099,["how He has made their attention so beautiful"]],[2104,["that they enjoy all the beautiful things of the world,"]],[2109,["all the innocent things of the world.”"]],[2112,["And there are many people like them, I can tell you, who are struggling."]],[2117,["Not that all the society has accepted this nonsense."]],[2120,["There are many who are struggling"]],[2122,["because I know in England they published a book about what children have to say"]],[2128,["about the politicians: very sweet, sweet things, very sweet."]],[2132,["And those books [that] were published were five thousand books because"]],[2135,["if you publish five thousand, you get it cheaper or something like that."]],[2139,["And in one day all the books were sold out – in one day."]],[2145,["That shows that there are so many people still"]],[2149,["who are respecting their innocence and they want to be innocent"]],[2155,["and they want to enjoy it."]],[2157,["But a society has to be created of that kind."]],[2160,["For that, you must have a kind of a personality."]],[2166,["You know that I was in London and once I went to Greece."]],[2173,["And the ministers’ wives also came to meet me."]],[2176,["I was surprised. Normally they don’t do. So they said,"]],[2179,["“You see, our husbands told us if you want to see serenity personified,"]],[2185,["then you must see Mrs. Shrivastava.”"]],[2189,["I was surprised [that] in Greece they are talking of serenity!"]],[2193,["In these modern times anybody talking about purity!"]],[2198,["I just couldn’t understand, but I felt at the back of their mind"]],[2202,["their tradition, whatever it is, these men could see"]],[2209,["that simple thing in me and they went and told them."]],[2212,["And they all enjoyed my company very much."]],[2215,["I was making them laugh and telling them things and all that."]],[2218,["And one of them then turned around and said,"]],[2221,["“Mrs. Shrivastava, you are just like a child!” “I said, “Really?”"]],[2224,["“No, we enjoyed your company so much!”"]],[2226,["And when I was coming, they were in tears."]],[2229,["So what I am saying that: whatever innocent personality you have,"]],[2235,["you have to project now, to project towards others."]],[2238,["Say somebody is trying to be funny with you"]],[2242,["just with one glance you can put that person right,"]],[2245,["that you don’t like it. Just to say you don’t like it."]],[2251,["In a way that’s a projection."]],[2255,["Around your society, around where you are working,"]],[2259,["you will also find people who have no sense of innocence."]],[2264,["And it’s disgusting to be with them."]],[2268,["But as you have powers, you must use [them] – is to project."]],[2273,["I see with Sahaja Yogis, they don’t even cure people."]],[2277,["They’ll tell me, “Mother, he is to be cured. That is to be done.”"]],[2281,["But you are so many, why do you need me to do that now?"]],[2285,["You all can cure a patient. You can help the patient."]],[2289,["Why can’t you do it? What is the need for me to do it?"]],[2293,["You have those qualities within you"]],[2297,["because potentially you had them before"]],[2300,["and now they are enlightened through the grace of Shri Ganesha."]],[2305,["Now, what you have to do is to assert them."]],[2310,["In that, of course, you must remember not to use your ego,"]],[2316,["not to use your mind. So somebody would say that,"]],[2321,["“Mother, without mind how can you impress others?"]],[2325,["How can you have a rapport with others?” It’s very simple."]],[2329,["Just go thoughtless. Once you are thoughtless,"]],[2333,["you are in the Realm of the Divine, and then the Divine takes charge."]],[2339,["And it will start emitting such beautiful vibrations"]],[2343,["that you will be amazed at yourself how things are working out."]],[2348,["It is not a coincidence we should say."]],[2352,["Like once I was going somewhere and they told me that,"]],[2357,["“You have to be very careful!” I said, “Why?”"]],[2361,["“Because in the night, you see, these Naxalites (Indian communists) are here"]],[2365,["and they might just kill you.” I said, “It’s alright!”"]],[2368,["He said, “No, it’s very late. You be careful!”"]],[2373,["So, the gentleman with me was very much worried."]],[2376,["He said, “You take out your ornaments, everything.”"]],[2378,["He put them under the seat and did all that."]],[2383,["So, as soon as we reached that place where many Naxalites were standing"]],[2389,["with their lanterns and with their sticks,"]],[2394,["so I told the driver that, “For one minute you stop the car.”"]],[2398,["He said, “No, I will not!” “No, you stop!”"]],[2401,["I looked at them and I don’t know what happened – they just moved on."]],[2406,["I said, “Now speed up the car.”"]],[2409,["You see, it is the power that you have."]],[2411,["Unless and until you use this power of love and compassion,"]],[2416,["you will not know what you have got. And that comes from your Shri Ganesh."]],[2424,["You see, how children understand love."]],[2428,["If you are nice to them, how they react. Maybe sometimes they do not,"]],[2434,["but ninety-nine percent [of] children, I have seen, they really react to love."]],[2440,["In our school in Dharamsala there were two children"]],[2445,["and they were very troublesome to begin with"]],[2449,["and the parents were worried about them."]],[2452,["They sent them to Dharamsala"]],[2456,["and otherwise they were very demanding as the modern children are."]],[2460,["“You buy this. You buy that. Go here. We want MacDonald!”"]],[2464,["This, that was going on. When they went to the school for one year,"]],[2468,["they came back and the parents asked them,"]],[2471,["“Now, what do you want?” They said, “We don’t want anything!”"]],[2474,["“You don’t want anything? You want to go to MacDonald’s?”"]],[2477,["They were American. “No, no, we don’t want to go to MacDonald."]],[2480,["We want to sit here and watch Mother’s videos.”"]],[2488,["They said, “Suddenly, what has happened to them? They were so troublesome."]],[2490,["Why are they now so much changed? What’s the matter with them?”"]],[2495,["So then they said, “What about food? Whatever you cook, we’ll eat."]],[2499,["We are not bothered.”"]],[2500,["And they were amazed how these children had changed!"]],[2503,["But then they said, “We must go out somewhere."]],[2506,["We must see the river, we must see the mountain.”"]],[2508,["“Alright, that we’ll do.” Then again they came home"]],[2512,["– no demands, nothing. They didn’t want to go for any shopping"]],[2516,["or asking for any shirts or blouse or nothing."]],[2520,["Very much satisfied, dignified."]],[2527,["So they said, “What’s the matter with you? You don’t want anything?”"]],[2531,["“No we want something but we don’t know how to tell you.”"]],[2534,["“What is it?” “Because you don’t have that."]],[2537,["You can’t get it in the market.” “Well, what is it?”"]],[2540,["They said, “Can you get us a pendant of Shri Mataji?”"]],[2545,["So sweetly, you know, they said. That’s all."]],[2548,["But they said, “You don’t have?” “No, we don’t have any.”"]],[2551,["“So you just get us the pendant of Shri Mataji, that’s all.”"]],[2555,["I mean so deep expression. You don’t want anything else."]],[2563,["I mean, I know the children, I have met them,"]],[2567,["but I have not been with them for a long time,"]],[2569,["I have never been so close to them, nothing,"]],[2571,["but look at the love that they have."]],[2576,["And they were telling me in the school in the beginning"]],[2579,["that anybody goes to trouble us, we said,"]],[2582,["“Now we are going to inform Shri Mataji!”"]],[2585,["“No, no, no, don’t inform Her.” “Why?”"]],[2588,["“Because She will not love me any more!” Can you imagine?"]],[2592,["The value of my love is so much understood by these little, little children"]],[2599,["and so much they admire, they want it."]],[2606,["It has no material gain by that, nothing."]],[2612,["All this really shows that Christ as He has said it, that,"]],[2617,["“You have to be like small children to enter into the Kingdom of God.”"]],[2621,["Without that, you cannot enjoy anything."]],[2624,["Like yesterday’s programme was really, I must say"]],[2628,["– these Swiss have worked very hard."]],[2630,["They are very hard working I know, but not to this extent"]],[2633,["that they started singing Indian music so well in such a combination"]],[2640,["and we enjoyed all that very much."]],[2643,["Now imagine these Swiss who are overactive, always working,"]],[2651,["they have no time to think about creating something innocent,"]],[2657,["creating something sweet of this kind."]],[2662,["And the way they did it shows, really, that they love Shri Ganesha"]],[2667,["and they understand the value of Shri Ganesha’s manifestation in them."]],[2674,["I was really surprised how they could learn all this Indian music"]],[2679,["and so many sitting together and singing that song."]],[2683,["And there were some Indians, I said, “Can you sing like this?”"]],[2686,["They said, “No.” I said, “Look at these Swiss.”"]],[2689,["This is the power of Shri Ganesha’s love."]],[2693,["Because they were to celebrate Shri Ganesha’s birthday,"]],[2698,["so they got equipped from within."]],[2703,["But if they had not projected it there would have been nothing."]],[2707,["So whatever He is giving you, whatever He is creating in you,"]],[2711,["this beautiful innocence, this beautiful fragrance of your living,"]],[2719,["every moment, when you are enjoying it,"]],[2722,["also know that we have to give it to others."]],[2725,["We have to pour this into others."]],[2730,["And it will work out, I know it will work out."]],[2733,["It is so tremendous. His powers are so tremendous."]],[2737,["Yesterday you saw that in the children’s program"]],[2742,["that nobody could beat him, even Shiva, anyone."]],[2747,["And Shiva had to cut His head"]],[2751,["because He didn’t know how to overpower Him otherwise."]],[2756,["This is what we have to understand, that if you are innocent,"]],[2762,["nobody can cheat us, nobody can trouble us,"]],[2766,["because in innocence you become a person"]],[2771,["who doesn’t care for what is happening to you."]],[2775,["You become a person who tolerates everything thinking these are…"]],[2779,["you don’t even think, you feel they are something, stupid people, that’s all."]],[2785,["It is a story about a king in China, as I am going to China."]],[2791,["There was a king in China."]],[2793,["They are very wise people, I must say Chinese are extremely wise."]],[2797,["And he decided to win a cocks’ fight. It’s a cocks’ fight."]],[2807,["Imagine the king thinking like that! But it’s all child’s play."]],[2812,["So he went to one great saint and told him that,"]],[2815,["“How will you train a cock to fight the other cocks?”"]],[2821,["He said, “Leave the cock with me.”"]],[2823,["So he left the cock there and he trained him very well"]],[2829,["because when the king arrived after one month before the fight,"]],[2834,["he said, “See now, take this cock it’s your one.”"]],[2836,["He said, “This one? This one is not doing anything, just standing straight."]],[2840,["He said, “Yes, yes. That’s it. You take it.”"]],[2844,["So he took that cock and put him in that contest."]],[2852,["So all the cocks were together."]],[2856,["They started troubling this cock, which was just standing like this as if,"]],[2860,["“Some stupid people are trying to trouble me.”"]],[2864,["He wouldn’t touch them, he wouldn’t react, nothing of the kind,"]],[2867,["he was just standing straight."]],[2869,["So all the cocks were surprised that, “This one is not protesting."]],[2874,["He’s just bearing up everything and he’s not bothered as to what we are doing.”"]],[2879,["One by one all the cocks disappeared from the field"]],[2884,["where they were having these fights."]],[2887,["And this was the only cock which stood up."]],[2892,["So the king was surprised. He took him to the saint and he said,"]],[2898,["“This one has become a saint now. So it’s better you keep it with you!”"]],[2902,["He’s such a saint that they were all trying to trouble him and he was least bothered."]],[2907,["He was looking like this, left side, right side, both sides."]],[2910,["He thought, “What’s going on with these people? Why are they behaving like this?”"]],[2914,["So this is what I have to tell you that your personality itself"]],[2919,["is made like that and now you worship Him so much [that] He’s within you."]],[2925,["And any kind of problems that you have will be really solved very easily"]],[2935,["if you take to your innocence."]],[2938,["And that will create coincidences, as they call it."]],[2943,["But I would say it’s not coincidence, it’s the vibrations."]],[2949,["And you’ll be amazed how things are solved."]],[2953,["They’ll say, “Mother, this had happened, that had happened.”"]],[2955,["Now see, the other day, it rained so much."]],[2958,["It rained so much so that they said,"]],[2960,["“It has become knee-deep mud here and Mother what are we to do?”"]],[2965,["I said, “It’s alright. Leave it to Him.”"]],[2968,["Next day it was very hot. Imagine underneath these things,"]],[2973,["the whole thing got dried out and today you are here for the puja."]],[2980,["It’s an impossible thing that there could be such a change in the weather"]],[2987,["that one day it rains so heavily and second day"]],[2992,["the whole thing gets absolutely dried out."]],[2996,["It’s His work, because He’s so much powerful."]],[3002,["You have come to worship Him, so first of all cleansing has to be done"]],[3008,["and He did the cleansing by putting the rain here."]],[3013,["It’s so heavy rains and some of the part of the rains"]],[3018,["which came near this Palazzo Dorio they turned into ice (hail)."]],[3032,["I don’t know what is English word is [for] that."]],[3034,["So they all started and the whole thing went round the house."]],[3040,["They were all forming into little, little ice-balls, falling nearby."]],[3047,["Now it is something unbelievable that all over it has just rained"]],[3053,["only near our house it is the ice-balls are coming."]],[3056,["We can call it ‘miracles’, we can call it anything,"]],[3060,["but it is Shri Ganesha’s, we should say, sensitivity"]],[3065,["that He thought that, “Now this rain is going near my Mother’s house,"]],[3070,["so let us make some sort of a beautiful ice-balls.”"]],[3075,["And I went out and I saw, and I was amazed"]],[3078,["how it was all around my house [that] there were ice-balls."]],[3083,["What He can do, what he’s capable is absolutely unbelievable."]],[3091,["How He guides you and how He helps you."]],[3094,["How He takes you to [the] right path."]],[3097,["Not only that [but] how He protects you."]],[3099,["All the time He is with you because you have become His ganas now."]],[3105,["You are His ganas, so He protects you, looks after you,"]],[3109,["gives you all the guidance. He takes you to the right path."]],[3114,["He takes you to the righteous road."]],[3119,["He gives you all that is dharmic to enjoy."]],[3123,["You always meet friends here and there."]],[3126,["You think it’s a coincidence – it is not."]],[3128,["And that is how He works."]],[3131,["He works with all His beautiful, sweet, loving attention on you"]],[3140,["because you are His ganas."]],[3143,["But the ganas have to work!"]],[3147,["As I say that, in our body there are ganas"]],[3153,["and they fight the disease, they fight the problems that are in the body"]],[3161,["those antibodies which are the ganas of Shri Ganesha."]],[3168,["In the same way, you are also His ganas."]],[3171,["He does all this for you. He protects you, He loves you,"]],[3174,["He gives you all the good time."]],[3178,["Then what are we doing about it?"]],[3180,["It should not be one-sided. When He does all this for you"]],[3186,["then what should we do about Shri Ganesh?"]],[3190,["What can we do as antibodies?"]],[3194,["You don’t have to fight the enemies with any sword or any kind of a weapon."]],[3206,["The enemies you can conquer by simple, two, methods."]],[3213,["One is try your love, your pure love on them. Try that."]],[3220,["You may melt away many people."]],[3222,["Or else, if that is not working, then what should you do"]],[3229,["is to sit down and meditate and give bandhans."]],[3234,["There are ways of giving bandhans. The bandhan works so fast"]],[3238,["and so beautifully that you are amazed how it has worked!"]],[3243,["Because you are so powerful."]],[3246,["The way you give bandhan, [if] anybody else can give"]],[3249,["it is not going to work! It’s only you, the Sahaj Yogis, can give bandhan."]],[3254,["There are different types of bandhans you have to give."]],[3258,["And all that works out so well."]],[3262,["So we have to have now faith in our own powers"]],[3266,["and we have to know that we are now empowered by Shri Ganesha"]],[3272,["to do the work of Sahaja Yoga."]],[3275,["To do the work of Sahaja Yoga is not to feel that you are doing it,"]],[3280,["but it is Shri Ganesh who is doing it."]],[3284,["You will be surprised – giving Realisations to people"]],[3288,["is the greatest joy Sahaja Yogis can have."]],[3292,["And then you don’t have to think that you have done it"]],[3296,["– then is the best – but if you think you have done it then,"]],[3300,["“I am very tired,” or “I have done this!”"]],[3303,["Many people come and tell me, “Mother, we have done this, we have done that!”"]],[3308,["That means they are just feeling the strain of doing any work."]],[3314,["But you are not to feel any strain."]],[3317,["His powers are within you, you can see it. Believe me!"]],[3322,["Believe in yourself. Have confidence in yourself"]],[3325,["– confidence and faith in yourself."]],[3327,["And [know] that you are a storehouse of innocence"]],[3332,["which is nothing but compassion and love."]],[3337,["If you have that faith"]],[3339,["you will definitely develop a beautiful way of talking to others,"]],[3346,["of having [a] relationship with others."]],[3356,["It is something that is really a gift of Shri Ganesh."]],[3364,["I don’t think I every shouted at anyone."]],[3369,["Even on my children, I have never shouted, never."]],[3373,["I have never got into a fury or a temper"]],[3376,["because I think I can manage without it."]],[3378,["Of course, I had to correct, I had to tell people."]],[3382,["But one thing I have seen [is] that everybody has been afraid of one thing"]],[3388,["– that somehow I should never drive out somebody from Sahaja Yoga,"]],[3392,["because Sahaja Yoga is such a joy,"]],[3395,["it is such an energy-giving thing,"]],[3398,["it is such a light that you feel absolutely confident about yourself."]],[3409,["So to ask you to leave Sahaja Yoga"]],[3412,["is the greatest punishment because you can’t leave me now."]],[3418,["It’s difficult. You just can’t leave me! It’s impossible!"]],[3423,["And that is what it is that you also develop those qualities"]],[3427,["that you can’t leave."]],[3430,["See, a child, if it is lost, I mean, the parents just go off,"]],[3435,["they don’t know how the child is lost."]],[3438,["But supposing, some son of theirs is a very bad boy,"]],[3444,["is misbehaving, is doing all kinds of wrong things, they don’t mind."]],[3450,["But when they are young, they are innocent"]],[3452,["it’s some sort of a tremendous attachment to them"]],[3457,["and understanding that “They are our children, we have to look after them.”"]],[3463,["So [it’s] this innocence that attracts you,"]],[3467,["that keeps you wondering about your children, about other children."]],[3473,["And I was very happy the way you gave a present to Guido"]],[3478,["because he’s doing a very difficult task, I must say."]],[3482,["And this appreciation shows that to you it’s very valuable"]],[3488,["that your children are looked after."]],[3491,["But you are also a child of your Mother."]],[3494,["As a result, you have all these powers within yourself."]],[3499,["But you must know how to smile. You must know how to win over people."]],[3505,["Still there are some Sahaj Yogis and some Sahaj Yoginis"]],[3509,["who are still rather stiff! I find them little stiff type"]],[3514,["and they can’t give up their stiffness."]],[3516,["Maybe they think no end of themselves or whatever it is."]],[3519,["Then they will not enjoy Sahaja Yoga."]],[3522,["Of course, mentally of course they understand Sahaj Yog and all that"]],[3525,["but they cannot enjoy fully Sahaj Yoga and all its mirth, its joyous moments."]],[3534,["Today is to celebrate His birth"]],[3539,["and He was the first God that was created on this Earth;"]],[3544,["because he’s also auspiciousness, he’s also Holiness."]],[3551,["So the Primordial Mother didn’t want to create this world"]],[3556,["without first creating the holiness, the auspiciousness, the purity."]],[3563,["And that’s why He was first created."]],[3567,["Created on this Earth with vibrations, just [a] bundle of vibrations:"]],[3572,["so that He can look after all the people"]],[3576,["who are going to come from ages to ages,"]],[3584,["to guide them always on the right path."]],[3589,["So He is supposed to be in charge of our conscience,"]],[3594,["the conscience that eats you up sometimes, that says,"]],[3598,["“This is not alright. This I should not have done."]],[3601,["That I should have not done.”"]],[3603,["But one should try to take very great pride in it."]],[3608,["Like there was one gentleman, an Indian"]],[3612,["– Indians can be exceptionally innocent sometimes, exceptionally,"]],[3615,["you can’t understand them! So I told him,"]],[3619,["“Why did you give up your land?”"]],[3623,["He said, “Mother, I thought that later on, when my children will grow,"]],[3627,["I might become greedy and I may not give this land to my brother,"]],[3632,["who deserves it because I’m too clever, I can cheat him."]],[3636,["So I thought it’s better to give up."]],[3638,["So I gave up the land to my brother.”"]],[3640,["And he so innocently was telling me that,"]],[3645,["“I should not become greedy because maybe that my children will grow up"]],[3651,["and I will feel that I must give all this to my children,"]],[3654,["so I decided to give up the land just now to my own brother.”"]],[3658,["But I said, “What about your brother?”"]],[3660,["He said, “He deserves, he needs. I don’t need so much land."]],[3664,["I am doing very well in life. That’s why I have given.”"]],[3667,["“But legally?” “Legally,” he said, “it was not in his name,"]],[3672,["but I thought it’s better that I give it to him now."]],[3675,["Later on I might become a bad man.”"]],[3678,["So the innocence works out in such a manner."]],[3681,["And very sweet, sweet stories I have got to tell you."]],[3684,["There’s one Sahaj Yogi who was a little boy, say about sixteen years of old,"]],[3689,["he came to me and he said, “My mother has some badhas and the father, too."]],[3693,["I don’t know what to do."]],[3695,["Now supposing I leave my father and mother,"]],[3698,["then will the badhas also leave me?” I said, “Maybe. May not be. Depends on…”"]],[3705,["“Then what is the need for people to leave their parents"]],[3708,["when they are eighteen years of age? Why do people leave their parents"]],[3712,["at the eighteen years of age? Because, you see, it will be a big loss.”"]],[3716,["I said, “Why?” “Firstly, if I start smoking who will stop me?”"]],[3722,["Such an innocent thing. “If I start smoking,"]],[3726,["only my father can slap me on the face, nobody else."]],[3730,["So he can save me from the smoking.”"]],[3733,["I was amazed at his innocence, the way he was saying that,"]],[3738,["“I want my father to be there to slap me.”"]],[3740,["And then he said, “And then my mother, she’s the one"]],[3744,["who corrects me every point; so if she goes away, if I am not with her,"]],[3749,["who will correct me? Who will tell me don’t do this and don’t do that?”"]],[3753,["I never understood that, look at this boy of sixteen years"]],[3758,["– he’s an Indian – telling me that his parents’ utility is"]],[3762,["that they are the only people who can stop him from doing wrong things!"]],[3768,["Because he was a born-realised and he could see that,"]],[3773,["“if I try to do something wrong it’s only my parents can tell me.”"]],[3778,["So this innocence always seeks [a] virtuous life,"]],[3784,["this better life and it doesn’t assert on others."]],[3789,["But it’s, somehow or other, when there is innocence"]],[3793,["– just like you people are now Self-realised people –"]],[3796,["in the light of your Self, you don’t want to do something"]],[3801,["that is not innocent, that is not simple."]],[3805,["For example, I have never seen such honest people"]],[3808,["as we have in Sahaja Yoga. Absolutely honest, I mean,"]],[3812,["they don’t want to take even a single pie (1/192 Rupee) out of things."]],[3816,["Of course, there have been some horrible people, also,"]],[3819,["who made lots of money out of Sahaj Yog, doesn’t matter;"]],[3822,["but most of you have become so honest."]],[3825,["I mean there’s so much corruption in this world"]],[3828,["and to see people who are so honest."]],[3833,["Now the greatest quality, as you know, of Shri Ganesha’s"]],[3836,["I was told yesterday, that for them their Mother is the most important."]],[3841,["What Mother says and what Mother does, that’s the most important thing."]],[3847,["I mean, it is so much that I really can’t understand"]],[3853,["how you people are so much fond of me."]],[3859,["Because I think that, whatever you think about me mentally"]],[3869,["is nothing compared to what you have within yourself"]],[3872,["and that is Shri Ganesha’s, again, the quality."]],[3876,["Because He’s so attached to me"]],[3878,["that he will fight his Father, he will fight everybody."]],[3882,["That’s what you are."]],[3884,["Anything against me, you cannot tolerate,"]],[3886,["anything wrong said against me you cannot follow."]],[3890,["I have seen people getting furious if somebody said a word against me."]],[3895,["So this quality of love for me is coming from Shri Ganesha within you."]],[3902,["But the another quality, as I said, is that"]],[3905,["He makes the ganas work and so you have to work it out."]],[3910,["Yesterday’s thing has shown me how this collectivity"]],[3916,["of Switzerland has come up so well, so well."]],[3922,["And it was really showing how we can progress. You all have talents."]],[3930,["Not that only Swiss have. You all have talents."]],[3933,["You all have understanding. You are all intelligent."]],[3937,["All of you are special people and you have to work out in collective way"]],[3942,["and also individual way to show your quality of Shri Ganesh,"]],[3948,["the way He has the rhythm within Him."]],[3950,["He’s very rhythmic and yesterday those two big musicians sitting,"]],[3954,["he said, “Mother, they are so rhythmically clapping, they are rhythmic."]],[3960,["There’s no, ‘ha, ha, hoo, hoo,’ just clapping and so rhythmic."]],[3964,["Nobody makes a mistake.”"]],[3966,["Then they said, “When they sing also, nobody’s out of tune.”"]],[3970,["Normally, if ten people are singing, without proper training,"]],[3974,["then this are in alto, tenor, bass, everything, they go on."]],[3978,["And you don’t know on what swar (note) they have taken, on what note they are singing."]],[3983,["But they were yesterday very amazed that all of you were singing on the same note;"]],[3988,["you wouldn’t leave the note and come onto another note."]],[3992,["That shows that the rhythm of Shri Ganesha is working in you"]],[3996,["and His understanding of music, which is one of His qualities is:"]],[4004,["that He dances on the music of which Nataraja, the Father Shiva has taught Him."]],[4016,["It’s very rhythmic. That part, I think, a little bit, Sahaja Yogis are missing:"]],[4021,["that when they dance they need not be, all of them, in [a] very rhythmic pattern."]],[4026,["They’re alright, but still one has to learn [a] little more"]],[4029,["rhythmic pattern, would be a good idea."]],[4032,["As the Shri Ganesha, which is such a big stomach that He has,"]],[4036,["He dances so well, so lightly He lifts his body and the way He works it out, it’s amazing."]],[4042,["How does He do it with such a…and a short person with such thick legs?"]],[4048,["He is very light and the lightness comes because of innocence – Mooladhar."]],[4056,["If the Mooladhara is alright, then lightness is there."]],[4061,["You have seen in Maharashtra how these people were playing the Lezim (dance)"]],[4069,["with such speed and with such lightness:"]],[4075,["they were lifting their legs and hand."]],[4078,["It was really amazing how they were doing it."]],[4084,["And it is only the innocence of these people of the villages"]],[4090,["that they don’t understand much of this nonsense."]],[4094,["They don’t know what is going on with all these things."]],[4098,["They earn their living, they are farmers,"]],[4101,["and then in the evening they just sleep off in complete innocence."]],[4106,["They do not plan, they do not sit down and find out"]],[4110,["how to kill somebody, maybe something how to rob somebody"]],[4118,["or another bad things that people think"]],[4121,["– the bad action that comes into their minds. There is no time for that."]],[4125,["They work the whole day. In the evening, nicely they sleep."]],[4128,["Or else they will have a bhajan mandeley where they will all sing together"]],[4134,["in a very beautiful manner."]],[4136,["So it’s a real sahaj style where we don’t have to think"]],[4142,["about killing anybody or to murder anybody."]],[4145,["Like all these cults, they have weapons with them! I can’t understand."]],[4151,["Even I was told that in Poland our Pope maharaj sent lots of weapons there."]],[4158,["What is the need for anybody who is spiritual to have weapons around"]],[4163,["and think of violence and killing people?"]],[4166,["Because there is no innocence at all. You can see that."]],[4169,["If you are innocent your power is your innocence,"]],[4173,["you don’t have to have weapons and guns and things."]],[4178,["All these religions, so-called, are using nothing but weapons and guns"]],[4184,["and all kinds of killing objects and they are also killed."]],[4188,["It’s a funny thing going on in the name of God, in the name of Shri Ganesh."]],[4194,["There is no need for us to fight."]],[4196,["There is no need for us to think that we’ll kill this man or kill that one."]],[4201,["Only you have to just desire, project your energy"]],[4205,["and you will see [that] the person will disappear."]],[4208,["He’ll either become a transformed person"]],[4211,["or he will not be there to trouble you."]],[4216,["So, one thing I have to again stress is that we must know our qualities"]],[4221,["and our powers."]],[4225,["Many people I know could never come on the stage and speak also."]],[4229,["I said, “You get along – finished! Start it.” It worked out."]],[4235,["Anything, you just project. “I can do it! Why can’t I do it?”"]],[4239,["To say, “I can’t. I am sorry.”"]],[4243,["This ‘sorry’ is so common now."]],[4245,["On the telephone also people will say “sorry”.  I said, “What ‘sorry’?”"]],[4248,["All the time, “sorry, sorry, sorry.”"]],[4250,["We used to say, “I beg your pardon,” – was sensible."]],[4253,["But the way people are, “Poor me, you know. How can I do it?”"]],[4259,["All such people are not yet aware of their powers that they have."]],[4264,["You can do it, everything. You can."]],[4267,["Everything can be managed; after all, you have the power."]],[4271,["In that power you must know that you are not going to do something indiscreet,"]],[4276,["you are not going to spoil anybody,"]],[4279,["but your power itself will show that this power"]],[4284,["is really of love, affection, compassion for the transformation of the whole world."]],[4292,["I am thinking of the complete global transformation,"]],[4295,["which, I know, is a mad dream, but still I think like that,"]],[4301,["because I see you all, then I think you all can do it"]],[4307,["and when I see the Shri Ganesha in you, I am sure it will work out."]],[4315,["So, in my lifetime I have seen so many Sahaj Yogis, all over."]],[4321,["How things are worked out: you have heard about in Brazil"]],[4325,["and also in Argentina, most unexpected."]],[4328,["The people came to a program from twelve o’clock in the morning"]],[4332,["when we were going to have the program at seven o’clock!"]],[4336,["I reached there at about eight, as usual, and they said,"]],[4339,["“Mother, You won’t believe there was a big drama here!”"]],[4342,["I said, “What drama?” “They were sitting here from twelve o’clock,"]],[4345,["so all those who had come earlier got inside,"]],[4348,["but those who came at the last minute would not be allowed"]],[4352,["and they are sitting there and fighting,"]],[4354,["‘No, we are going to come inside somehow!’ ”"]],[4358,["So then, one of the Sahaja Yogis sensibly went and talked to the manager"]],[4362,["and told, “Baba, let them come! There is room.”"]],[4366,["So there were four tiers."]],[4367,["One was the ground, then one more, one more, one more."]],[4371,["When I came I saw, “What’s this?”"]],[4374,["All over, the whole thing was filled with these people."]],[4379,["I had never seen them before, but they were there,"]],[4383,["and so respectful, so much absorbing the vibrations."]],[4392,["And I found it difficult to control my tears out of a real feeling"]],[4398,["of such gratitude for Shri Ganesh."]],[4404,["He’s the one who worked it out."]],[4407,["That’s why they say always,"]],[4408,["“First worship Shri Ganesh before starting any work,”"]],[4412,["because then it gives you that peace,"]],[4415,["that tremendous powerful peace which works out so many things"]],[4421,["that you never thought it would."]],[4427,["So we have to request Shri Ganesha"]],[4432,["that all the problems of our land owning should be solved by Him"]],[4437,["and by your Shri Ganesh power."]],[4440,["We are still hoping to get the land"]],[4442,["and I want to install this properly for you because every time"]],[4446,["I don’t want you to suffer like this."]],[4448,["It’s a pilgrimage, but rather difficult this time you all had,"]],[4453,["but you managed it very nicely and you never showed"]],[4457,["any kind of a reluctance to accept this challenge."]],[4464,["Shri Ganesha was testing you I think also, a little bit."]],[4468,["But all that has worked out so well and now"]],[4471,["we are here to do the puja of Shri Ganesh."]],[4475,["May God Bless you."]]]);
